This folder contains materials sent on 22 October 2025 as a follow-up escalation under the Pre-Action Protocol.

On this date, the Claimant sent an urgent follow-up email to the Civil Appeals Registry, HMCTS, and the Ministry of Justice, with wide circulation to Parliament, equality bodies, and other oversight recipients for transparency.

The correspondence followed the Pre-Action Protocol Letter dated 20 October 2025 and enclosed:
• a Follow-Up Pre-Action Letter dated 21 October 2025 concerning the unlawful revocation of participation measures under FPR Part 3A;
• the original Pre-Action Protocol Letter and Annex A dated 20 October 2025; and
• the Court of Appeal application and bundle (CA-2024-001342), re-attached to ensure all recipients had the complete record.

No substantive appeal was pursued following this correspondence.

These documents are preserved here as part of the chronological procedural record.
